  "details": "Seems like something is funky when you try to play in vr with a xbox controller.\n\nWhen I start up the game I can move around a bit. But I can't use my right stick to rotate. So I'm stuck in one axis. I can also toggle my microphone and open the menu.\n\nWhen opening the menu I can't use trigger anymore to click things that I look at. And after trying to click something I can't close the menu again.\n\nWhen I used this configuration I got a mouse cursor to pop up. I think it was when I didn't have the window highlighted. Can't click anything with it. And when the window is selected. Where I look take priority again. But the cursor stays on screen without being able to do anything with it.\n\nVideo showing the cursor in action: https://youtu.be/CzRlrxS11nI",
